Question. 11 Write a query to display job title, employee name, and the difference between salary of the employee and minimum salary for the job.

SELECT 
    j.job_title, 
    CONCAT(e.first_name, ' ', e.last_name) AS employee_name, 
    e.salary - j.min_salary AS salary_difference 
FROM employees e 
JOIN jobs j 
    ON e.job_id = j.job_id;
